Package: Saqrmisc
Type: Package
Title: Miscellaneous Functions for Data Processing and Analysis
Version: 0.9.6
Authors@R: 
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", 
           email = "saqr@saqr.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package providing miscellaneous functions for data processing,
    statistical analysis, and visualization. Includes functions for latent profile
    clustering via the 'latents' package, comparison plots with statistical testing,
    and mosaic plot analysis for categorical variables. The package offers robust error
    handling, comprehensive documentation, and user-friendly interfaces for complex
    statistical tasks.
